<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Note" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Figure 3. Demand/capacity ratios of the distilled checks against the 1.0 limit; red bars exceed the limit. The generator draws this chart from the values above when it builds the sheet; it does not recalculate inside Mathcad.</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="537" left="18.00" top="10587.54" width="572.00" height="38.50" align-x="18.00" align-y="10596.04" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Note" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Failing checks not recomputed here (tool): End U grid · pile envelope clearance: Conservative square pile envelope includes the current horizontal placement allowance, pile embedment and required clear gap, enlarged by bar radius. Review shape-specific and fabrication tolerances separately.</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="538" left="18.00" top="10632.04" width="572.00" height="27.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="10640.54" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Note" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">The tool reports 67 PENDING items: 2 Service III and fatigue; 3 FDOT covers; 4 D-regions, end regions and the end grid; 58 actual-cage prerequisites behind the distilled checks (anchorage and closure, splices, load path).</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="539" left="18.00" top="10665.04" width="572.00" height="15.50" align-x="18.00" align-y="10673.54" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Note" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Detailing and geometry flags: 50 pass, as reported by the tool.</p></text>
</region>
</regions>
